  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "This report highlights the development of a framework called Harness Evolution in LLM Agents, which explores how to improve learning capabilities by leveraging the agent's experience and harness features. The report also discusses the application of this framework in improving performance of large language models (LLMs) and the integration of agent harnesses with model weights.",
  "facts": [
